#: ../../skills.md:1
msgid "Skills"
msgstr "Skills"

#: ../../skills.md:3
msgid ""
"A **skill** is a reusable pack of instructions the agent loads only when it's needed — a release "
"checklist, a project convention, a multi-step procedure. Keeping the <span class=\"marker\">full "
"text out of context until it's used</span> means you can have many skills without bloating every "
"request."
msgstr ""
"**Skill** 是一组按需加载的可复用指令，例如 release checklist、项目约定或多步流程。在真正使用前，<span class=\"marker\">完整内容不会进入 "
"context</span>，因此安装很多 skill 也不会让每次请求都变大。"

#: ../../skills.md:8
msgid "Creating and installing skills"
msgstr "创建和安装 skill"

#: ../../skills.md:10
msgid "What a skill looks like"
msgstr "Skill 的结构"

#: ../../skills.md:12
msgid "A skill is a folder containing a `SKILL.md` file with `name` and `description` frontmatter:"
msgstr "每个 skill 是一个包含 `SKILL.md` 的目录。文件 frontmatter 中必须有 `name` 和 `description`："

#: ../../skills.md:32
msgid ""
"nanocode only sees the `name` and `description` until the skill is used — the full body loads on "
"demand."
msgstr "使用 skill 前，nanocode 只会看到它的 `name` 和 `description`；正文会按需加载。"

#: ../../skills.md:35
msgid "Where skills come from"
msgstr "Skill 的来源"

#: ../../skills.md:37
msgid "nanocode discovers skills from two places:"
msgstr "nanocode 从两个位置发现 skill："

#: ../../skills.md:39
msgid "`.nanocode/skills/` — project-local, checked in with the repo"
msgstr "`.nanocode/skills/` — 项目级 skill，可随仓库提交"

#: ../../skills.md:40
msgid ""
"`~/.nanocode/skills/` — your personal skills, available everywhere (under `<data_dir>/skills/` "
"when `paths.data_dir` is customized)"
msgstr "`~/.nanocode/skills/` — 个人 skill，在所有项目中可用；自定义 `paths.data_dir` 后位于 `<data_dir>/skills/`"

#: ../../skills.md:43
msgid "If both define the same name, the **project** skill wins. List what's installed with `/skills`."
msgstr "如果两处存在同名 skill，**项目级**版本优先。使用 `/skills` 查看已安装列表。"

#: ../../skills.md:46
msgid "Using skills"
msgstr "使用 skill"

#: ../../skills.md:48
msgid "**On demand** — nanocode loads a skill itself when it's relevant to your request."
msgstr "**按需加载** — 当请求与某个 skill 相关时，nanocode 会自行加载。"

#: ../../skills.md:49
msgid ""
"**Inline** — type `$name` in a message (Tab-completes) to load a skill yourself <span "
"class=\"marker\">for that turn</span>."
msgstr "**行内引用** — 在消息中输入 `$name`（支持 Tab 补全），为<span class=\"marker\">当前一轮</span>显式加载该 skill。"

#: ../../skills.md:52
msgid "Using $skill mention to load a skill's instructions inline"
msgstr "使用 `$skill` 引用行内加载 skill 指令"

#: ../../skills.md:57
msgid "Loading a skill with $name inline."
msgstr "通过 `$name` 行内加载 skill。"

#: ../../skills.md:60
msgid "Bundled scripts"
msgstr "配套脚本"

#: ../../skills.md:62
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A skill can ship helper scripts alongside `SKILL.md`. Inside the body, `{skill_dir}` (or "
"`${SKILL_DIR}`) expands to the skill's absolute path, so instructions can point the agent at a "
"script to run through Bash:"
msgstr ""
"Skill 可以在 `SKILL.md` 旁附带辅助脚本。正文中的 `{skill_dir}`（或 `${SKILL_DIR}`）会展开为 skill 的绝对目录，因此可以让 agent 通过 "
"Bash 运行脚本："

